<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH MARCH CBANK FOREX RESERVES UP TO $11.718 BLN.</title>
<headline>CZECH MARCH CBANK FOREX RESERVES UP TO $11.718 BLN.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech central bank foreign exchange reserves rose to $11.718 billion at the end of March from 11.715 at the end of February, the Czech National Bank (CNB) said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
